        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: ElvenQuest\n- People: Sophie Winkleman, Anil Gupta, Richard Pinto, Stephen Mangan, Alistair McGowan, Darren Boyd, Kevin Eldon, Dave Lamb, Lord Frederick Windsor, Prince Michael of Kent, Queen Elizabeth II\n- Organizations: BBC Radio 4\n- Roles: actress\n\nFacts:\n- Sophie Lara Winkleman was born on 5 August 1980.\n- Sophie Winkleman is an English actress.\n- ElvenQuest is a comic fantasy broadcast on BBC Radio 4.\n- ElvenQuest was created by Anil Gupta and Richard Pinto.\n- ElvenQuest stars Stephen Mangan, Alistair McGowan, Darren Boyd, Kevin Eldon, Sophie Winkleman, and Dave Lamb.\n- Lord Frederick Windsor is the son of Prince Michael of Kent.\n- Prince Michael of Kent is Queen Elizabeth II's first cousin.\n- Sophie Winkleman is the wife of Lord Frederick Windsor.\n- Sophie Winkleman is formally referred to as Lady Frederick Windsor.\n- Sophie Winkleman continues to use her maiden name in her professional career.",
